    "language": "javascript",
    "source": "function ipInPrefix(ip, prefix) {\n  // compare the first prefix-length bits of ip and of the network address\n}\n\nfunction matchFlow(table, packet) {\n  // highest priority entry whose every match field agrees with the packet\n  return ['CONTROLLER'];\n}\n\nconsole.log(ipInPrefix('10.0.2.15', '10.0.2.0/24'));\n"
